<title>UK: Norway's Ekofisk Oct loadings up at 14.8 mln bbls.</title>
<headline>Norway's Ekofisk Oct loadings up at 14.8 mln bbls.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Ekofisk crude oil pipeline system is due to load 14.8 million barrels in October, up 400,000 barrels from September, traders said on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The October programme will consist of 13 cargoes of 500,000 barrels, 12 of 600,000 barrels and one each of 570,000 and 550,000 barrels.</p>
<p>This compares with 17 cargoes of 500,000 barrels, eight of 600,000 and one each of 570,000 and 550,000 barrels in the original September programme, the traders said.</p>
<p>-- Mark Thompson, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
